.Dd June 3, 2025
.Dt ZIP_GET_ARCHIVE_PREFIX 3
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm zip_get_archive_prefix
.Nd get zip archive prefix
.Sh LIBRARY
libzip (-lzip)
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In zip.h
.Ft zip_uint64_t
.Fn zip_get_archive_prefix "zip_t *archive"
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Fn zip_get_archive_prefix
function returns the length of the zip archive prefix.
.Sh RETURN VALUES
The length of the archive prefix or 0 if there is no prefix to the archive.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr libzip 3 ,
.Xr zip_file_set_prefix 3
.Sh HISTORY
.Fn zip_get_archive_prefix
was added in libzip 0.11.5.
.Sh AUTHORS
.An -nosplit
.An Dieter Baron Aq Mt dillo@nih.at
and
.An Thomas Klausner Aq Mt wiz@gatalith.at
